Cheiron

Cheiron FoundersCheiron co-founders (from left): Harshit Gupta, co-founder and chief technology officer; Minseok Bae, co-founder and CEO; and Jason Park, co-founder and chief product officer.

LOS ALTOS, Calif., July 22, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Cheiron, the operating system for drug programs, today announced an $8 million seed round led by Menlo Ventures, with the backing and strategic support of industry veterans including Moderna co-founder and MIT Institute Professor Robert Langer;
